# OS-Agnostic External Data Path
# Set this to the path on your host machine that contains your datasets.
# Default if unset: /Volumes (for MacOS external drives)
# Examples:
# MacOS: EXTERNAL_DATA_PATH=/Volumes
# Linux: EXTERNAL_DATA_PATH=/mnt/data
# Windows: EXTERNAL_DATA_PATH=D:/Data

EXTERNAL_DATA_PATH=/Volumes
